./docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r7-delta.log:2227:docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r6-delta.log:719:docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:3091:  9030	[高] [GRILL.md:11](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/GRILL.md:11) 证据：`{stage,reason,errorName}` 不足以区分真实拒付点。同一个 `RUN_COMPLETION_INVALID` 在 source completion 内至少覆盖 issuer 抛错、result 形状、artifact、rawReplay、proof、observation 等分支（[replay-completion.mjs:102](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:102) 至 [同文件:137](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:137)），distilled 又有另一组同码分支（[同文件:251](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:251) 至 [同文件:266](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:266)）。更关键的是 raw observer 的 `begin/finish` await 没有 catch（[raw-replay-runner.mjs:286](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-replay-runner.mjs:286)、[同文件:329](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-replay-runner.mjs:329)），抛错会最终只留下泛化 `Error/TypeError`，不会产生可定位的逐事件记录。修法：增加闭合枚举 `refusalPoint`/`phase`，至少区分 issuer throw、result shape、artifact shape、raw status、proof、observation、observer begin/finish、formal replay 和 prepared-runtime 各分支；仅补充结构化枚举/计数，仍禁止 message。A4 必须证明每个同码生产点都能唯一归因。
